(1844,2,1780041936,'attendance','emailcontent','Hi %userfirstname%,\r\nYour attendance in %coursename% %attendancename% has dropped below %warningpercent% and is currently %percent% - we hope you are ok!\r\n\r\nTo get the most out of this course you should improve your attendance, please get in touch if you require any further support.',NULL),
