(3,NULL,'{\"showCoverPage\":false,\"bookCover\":{\"coverDescription\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><\\/p>\"},\"chapters\":[{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"decorative\":false,\"contentName\":\"Image\",\"expandImage\":\"Expand Image\",\"minimizeImage\":\"Minimize Image\",\"file\":{\"path\":\"images\\/file-6a081e39cb4d9.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":276,\"height\":183},\"alt\":\"Software komputer\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Image 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"e49f2cf8-852e-4445-be14-9a668ffca32e\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Image\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Image\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"c95cfab2-b8ed-464c-bf0e-4b1715d2cce9\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"0bcdc729-e14f-417d-b11b-b870f9ef4943\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>Software (perangkat lunak) adalah kumpulan instruksi, data, atau program digital yang digunakan untuk mengoperasikan komputer dan menjalankan tugas tertentu. Software tidak berwujud fisik, namun berfungsi sebagai nyawa yang memberitahu perangkat keras (<em>hardware<\\/em>) bagaimana cara bekerja. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/id.wikipedia.org\\/wiki\\/Perangkat_lunak\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/idcloudhost.com\\/blog\\/pengertian-software-fungsi-jenis-spesifikasi-dan-contoh-software\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=A1tkLAnO52o\\\">4<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jagoanhosting.com\\/blog\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">5<\\/a>]<\\/p><p>Berikut adalah pengelompokan utama software beserta fungsinya:<\\/p><p><strong>1. Sistem Operasi (Operating System)<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Program utama yang mengelola seluruh sumber daya perangkat keras dan menyediakan landasan untuk menjalankan aplikasi lainnya. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jagoanhosting.com\\/blog\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">1<\\/a>]<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Contoh:<\\/strong> Windows, macOS, Linux (untuk PC); serta Android dan iOS (untuk <em>smartphone<\\/em>). [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jagoanhosting.com\\/blog\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">1<\\/a>]<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>2. Software Aplikasi<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Program yang dirancang khusus untuk membantu pengguna menyelesaikan tugas-tugas tertentu, baik untuk pekerjaan, hiburan, maupun kreativitas. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/09\\/simak-berikut-6-jenis-software-berdasarkan-kegunaannya\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=A1tkLAnO52o\\\">2<\\/a>]<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Contoh:<\\/strong><ul><li><strong>Perkantoran:<\\/strong> Microsoft Office, Google Workspace.<\\/li><li><strong>Desain:<\\/strong> Adobe Photoshop, CorelDraw.<\\/li><li><strong>Browser:<\\/strong> Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.domainesia.com\\/berita\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bsi.today\\/pengertian-perangkat-lunak-software\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/crp.uid.ac.id\\/client\\/ujian\\/JadwalUjianID_5558\\/jawaban\\/2120049_Fitria_Mentari_-_Aplikasi_Program_Komputer.pdf\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/09\\/simak-berikut-6-jenis-software-berdasarkan-kegunaannya\\/\\\">4<\\/a>]<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>3. Software Utilitas (Utility)<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Program yang membantu memelihara, mengoptimalkan, dan mengamankan kinerja komputer. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.sman15-bdl.sch.id\\/2015\\/09\\/perangkat-lunak-software-komputer.html\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/diengcyber.com\\/pengertian-utility-software-jenis-jenisdll-yuk-cermati-penjelasan-di-bawah-ini\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/diengcyber.com\\/https-contohdomain-com-system-software\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/diengcyber.com\\/software-komputer-komponen-esensial-dalam-teknologi-modern\\/\\\">4<\\/a>]<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Contoh:<\\/strong> Antivirus, pembersih <em>file<\\/em> sampah (disk cleaner), dan aplikasi <em>backup<\\/em> data. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.domainesia.com\\/berita\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/fikti.umsu.ac.id\\/apa-itu-software-komputer-jenis-fungsi-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/diengcyber.com\\/software-utilitas-pengertian-jenis-dan-peranannya-dalam-pengelolaan-sistem-komputer\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/diengcyber.com\\/software-komputer-komponen-esensial-dalam-teknologi-modern\\/\\\">4<\\/a>]<\\/li><\\/ul><p><strong>4. Bahasa Pemrograman<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Perangkat lunak yang digunakan untuk menulis, mengembangkan, dan menerjemahkan kode menjadi program baru. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/infrasec.proxsisgroup.com\\/software-development-pengertian-manfaat-proses-jenis-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jagoanhosting.com\\/blog\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">4<\\/a>]<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Contoh:<\\/strong> Python, Java, C++, dan PHP. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.hashmicro.com\\/id\\/blog\\/apa-itu-software-engineering\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/blog.rumahweb.com\\/software-adalah\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">4<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/idcloudhost.com\\/blog\\/pengertian-software-fungsi-jenis-spesifikasi-dan-contoh-software\\/\\\">5<\\/a>]<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Untuk mempelajari lebih lanjut mengenai perbedaan instruksi dasar dan program aplikasi, Anda dapat membaca penjelasan lengkapnya di <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/binus.ac.id\\/malang\\/2024\\/08\\/software-pengertian-fungsi-ciri-ciri-dan-contohnya\\/\\\">Binus University<\\/a> atau lihat definisi dari <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/id.wikipedia.org\\/wiki\\/Perangkat_lunak\\\">Wikipedia<\\/a>.<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"cc8f7363-7d0c-4df0-a719-7dcca8bd7760\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"3c2c9c8a-0781-4c34-9b0d-b10ef6dfa240\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"3a6465c4-8af2-4451-86c3-68a8f23aab71\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"cards\":[{\"image\":{\"path\":\"images\\/image-6a081e97ecfc9.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":276,\"height\":183},\"imageAlt\":\"software\",\"match\":{\"path\":\"images\\/match-6a081ea2bb700.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":276,\"height\":183},\"matchAlt\":\"software\"},{\"image\":{\"path\":\"images\\/image-6a081eac16554.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":225,\"height\":225},\"imageAlt\":\"hardware\",\"match\":{\"path\":\"images\\/match-6a081eb36d30f.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":225,\"height\":225},\"matchAlt\":\"hardware\"},{\"image\":{\"path\":\"images\\/image-6a081ebdbcf1b.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":250,\"height\":202},\"imageAlt\":\"brainware\",\"match\":{\"path\":\"images\\/match-6a081ecb4bef7.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":250,\"height\":202},\"matchAlt\":\"brainware\"}],\"behaviour\":{\"useGrid\":true,\"allowRetry\":true},\"lookNFeel\":{\"themeColor\":\"#707070\"},\"l10n\":{\"cardTurns\":\"Card turns\",\"timeSpent\":\"Time spent\",\"feedback\":\"Good work!\",\"tryAgain\":\"Reset\",\"closeLabel\":\"Close\",\"label\":\"Memory Game.\\u00a0Find the matching cards.\",\"done\":\"All of the cards have been found.\",\"cardPrefix\":\"Card %num of %total:\",\"cardUnturned\":\"Unturned. Click to turn.\",\"cardTurned\":\"Turned.\",\"cardMatched\":\"Match found.\",\"cardMatchedA11y\":\"Your cards match!\",\"cardNotMatchedA11y\":\"Your chosen cards do not match. Turn other cards to try again.\"}},\"library\":\"H5P.MemoryGame 1.3\",\"subContentId\":\"bb6ea06e-e331-4458-9453-da11df102430\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Memory Game\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Memory Game\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"9df380c9-a79c-4b2f-91da-b0d72edf95d0\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"f3978f1e-1508-48d9-bc81-f0ae38fe37d9\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Column 1.20\",\"subContentId\":\"93b5189e-03ef-46e0-a31b-e5a591336240\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Page\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Bab 1 Software\"}},{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"decorative\":false,\"contentName\":\"Image\",\"expandImage\":\"Expand Image\",\"minimizeImage\":\"Minimize Image\",\"file\":{\"path\":\"images\\/file-6a081f0d050b8.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":225,\"height\":225},\"alt\":\"hardware\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Image 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"43e468e2-39b6-426e-a0f8-02fea1dbcf3e\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Image\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Image\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"d057c22c-5e3d-4794-ae46-1640786b3524\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"64c9d85f-48fb-4532-9bc8-202e54466103\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>Hardware, atau perangkat keras, adalah semua komponen fisik pada sistem komputer atau perangkat elektronik yang bisa dilihat dan disentuh. Ini merupakan \\\"tubuh\\\" dari perangkat yang berfungsi untuk menjalankan instruksi, memproses data, serta menampilkan hasil. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bit.telkomuniversity.ac.id\\/pengertian-hardware-fungsi-dan-contohnya-penjelasan-lengkap\\/\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bsi.today\\/pengertian-perangkat-keras-hardware\\/\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/id.wikipedia.org\\/wiki\\/Perangkat_keras\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.tempo.co\\/sains\\/pengertian-hardware-fungsi-beserta-contohnya-91977\\\">4<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/satu.xl.co.id\\/berita-dan-artikel\\/pengertian-software-dan-hardware\\\">5<\\/a>]<\\/p><p><strong>Jenis-jenis Utama Hardware<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Hardware pada umumnya dibagi menjadi beberapa kategori berdasarkan fungsinya: [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.gamelab.id\\/news\\/1353-3-komponen-utama-mesin-komputer-hardware-software-dan-brainware\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.acerid.com\\/berita-teknologi\\/macam-macam-perangkat-keras-komputer-hardware-yang-wajib-ada-di-ruang-kerja\\\">2<\\/a>]<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Perangkat Masukan (Input Device):<\\/strong> Berfungsi untuk memasukkan data atau perintah ke dalam sistem.<ul><li><em>Contoh:<\\/em> Keyboard, mouse, touchpad, dan webcam.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li><strong>Perangkat Pemrosesan (Processing Device):<\\/strong> Berfungsi untuk mengolah data dan instruksi yang masuk.<ul><li><em>Contoh:<\\/em> CPU (Central Processing Unit), GPU (Graphics Processing Unit), dan RAM.<\\/li><li><strong>Perangkat Keluaran (Output Device):<\\/strong> Berfungsi menampilkan hasil dari proses data kepada pengguna.<ul><li><em>Contoh:<\\/em> Monitor, speaker, dan printer.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li><strong>Perangkat Penyimpanan (Storage Device):<\\/strong> Berfungsi untuk menyimpan data secara permanen maupun sementara.<ul><li><em>Contoh:<\\/em> Harddisk, SSD (Solid State Drive), dan <em>flashdisk<\\/em>.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"ad944f6d-2afa-4640-bf52-3fe805940553\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"32763e53-c35f-45dc-8477-dfbafdbf2677\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"42d9b529-dd5a-4544-a16f-04ded867334c\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"iconType\":\"icon\",\"icon\":\"plus\",\"color\":\"#981d99\",\"hotspots\":[{\"position\":{\"x\":29.333331298828124,\"y\":42.59787235597406},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>monitor<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"b0a5cb3b-6903-40a0-b97f-292d0b7c0711\"}]},{\"position\":{\"x\":61.33333129882812,\"y\":73.5642504709033},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>keyboard<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"bc7d6a82-6fc7-433a-a6d1-9d8f3256a9ba\"}]},{\"position\":{\"x\":37.33333129882813,\"y\":78.34654929188316},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>mouse<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"e9abbb1b-1b2a-486f-af27-426a0a3713b8\"}]},{\"position\":{\"x\":69.40535583496093,\"y\":56.9704213183944},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>Printer<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"d05cafad-fe7a-4bbe-8ca2-70b7de19a569\"}]},{\"position\":{\"x\":29.805355834960938,\"y\":22.54452844695028},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>webcam<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"c771bc57-75cf-4c79-9245-e3a208e78ddd\"}]},{\"position\":{\"x\":55.00535583496094,\"y\":35.43855715017939},\"alwaysFullscreen\":false,\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p>pc<\\/p>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Text 1.1\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"},\"subContentId\":\"5e69453b-77e1-47ce-a1a8-bd2a68088bb9\"}]}],\"hotspotNumberLabel\":\"Hotspot #num\",\"closeButtonLabel\":\"Close\",\"containsAudioVideoLabel\":\"Contains Audio\\/Video\",\"image\":{\"path\":\"images\\/image-6a081f7ddee73.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":660,\"height\":400},\"backgroundImageAltText\":\"hardware\"},\"library\":\"H5P.ImageHotspots 1.10\",\"subContentId\":\"059e2439-ed1d-45e6-b3d1-9621a754a50a\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Image Hotspots\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Image Hotspots\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"9b839ef7-a37c-45e0-9af5-f5fac7ad2f82\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"c1886c8e-21c0-4340-a4d9-e0f2120466cb\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Column 1.20\",\"subContentId\":\"10ab799a-d6bc-49e4-806f-6d36e3e2628c\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Page\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Bab 2 Hardware\"}},{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"decorative\":false,\"contentName\":\"Image\",\"expandImage\":\"Expand Image\",\"minimizeImage\":\"Minimize Image\",\"file\":{\"path\":\"images\\/file-6a08201f1dd76.jpg\",\"mime\":\"image\\/jpeg\",\"copyright\":{\"license\":\"U\"},\"width\":250,\"height\":202},\"alt\":\"brainware\"},\"library\":\"H5P.Image 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"415597d1-5afb-49d1-8159-b550ff928b4d\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Image\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Image\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"0bb17dc3-fe57-42af-bad0-fa2bb26b9702\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"338b15da-4a1d-4071-b2f0-3ba4274cd527\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":100,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"text\":\"<p><strong>Brainware<\\/strong> adalah manusia yang merancang, menggunakan, atau mengoperasikan sistem komputer. Bersama perangkat keras (hardware) dan perangkat lunak (software), brainware adalah komponen vital yang menjadi \\\"otak\\\" penggerak agar sebuah sistem dapat berfungsi dan bermanfaat secara maksimal. [<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.cakrawala.ac.id\\/berita\\/apa-itu-brainware\\\">1<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=1jc1vilNhRc&amp;t=96\\\">2<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nevacloud.com\\/blog\\/brainware-adalah\\/\\\">3<\\/a>, <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/p5.smpbustanulmakmur.sch.id\\/brainware\\/\\\">4<\\/a>]<\\/p><p><strong>Jenis dan Peran Utama Brainware<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li><strong>Programmer:<\\/strong> Bertugas menulis kode, merancang, dan membuat program (software) agar komputer dapat melakukan tugas tertentu.<\\/li><li><strong>System Analyst:<\\/strong> Merancang arsitektur teknologi dan mengevaluasi sistem agar bekerja selaras dengan kebutuhan bisnis.<\\/li><li><strong>Administrator Sistem:<\\/strong> Bertanggung jawab untuk mengelola, mengatur, dan menjaga kelancaran operasional jaringan atau sistem suatu organisasi.<\\/li><li><strong>Operator:<\\/strong> Pengguna akhir (<em>end user<\\/em>) yang memakai program dan perangkat komputer untuk menyelesaikan tugas-tugas operasional sehari-hari<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"library\":\"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"62bdcbac-d8b6-43c2-9ee6-7648e894ca81\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Text\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Text\"}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.RowColumn 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"482d2c00-827d-4975-97c7-e426eeed9849\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Column\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Column\"}}}]},\"library\":\"H5P.Row 1.1\",\"subContentId\":\"0c47f937-5eac-4330-8c05-717d7ab17dd4\",\"metadata\":{\"contentType\":\"Row\",\"license\":\"U\",\"title\":\"Untitled Row\"}}},{\"content\":{\"params\":{\"columns\":[{\"width\":50,\"content\":{\"params\":{\"content\":[{\"params\":{\"media\":{\"disableImageZooming\":false},\"answers\":[{\"correct\":false,\"tipsAndFeedback\":{},\"text\":\"<div>keyboard<\\/div>\"},{\"correct\":true,\"tipsAndFeedback\":{},\"text\":\"<div>windows<\\/div>\"},{\"correct\":false,\"tipsAndFeedback\":{},\"text\":\"<div>manusia<\\/div>\"}],\"overallFeedback\":[{\"from\":0,\"to\":100}],\"behaviour\":{\"enableRetr